<section class="bp-cookie-banner" data-bp-consent-banner aria-labelledby="bp-cookie-title" hidden>
  <div>
    <h2 id="bp-cookie-title">A little insight. A better experience.</h2>
    <p>With your permission, we use Google Analytics cookies to understand visits and menu, reservation and contact activity. <button type="button" data-bp-modal-open="bp-analytics-notice" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="bp-analytics-notice">About analytics</button></p>
  </div>
  <div class="bp-cookie-actions">
    <button type="button" data-bp-consent="denied">Decline analytics</button>
    <button type="button" data-bp-consent="granted">Allow analytics</button>
  </div>
</section>
<button type="button" class="bp-cookie-settings" data-bp-consent-settings data-bp-modal-open="bp-analytics-notice" aria-controls="bp-analytics-notice" aria-haspopup="dialog">Privacy &amp; cookies</button>
<dialog class="bp-about-modal bp-analytics-notice" id="bp-analytics-notice" aria-labelledby="bp-analytics-title" data-bp-modal>
  <div class="bp-about-close-bar"><form method="dialog"><button class="bp-modal-close" aria-label="Close analytics information" autofocus>&times;</button></form></div>
  <article class="bp-about-copy">
    <p class="bp-about-eyebrow">Boardwalk Prime · Your privacy</p>
    <h2 id="bp-analytics-title">Analytics &amp; cookies</h2>
    <div class="bp-about-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <p>With your permission, this website uses Google Analytics to help us understand how guests find and use our website. This includes pages visited, traffic sources, approximate location, device and browser information, and interactions with the menu, reservation link and contact options.</p>
    <p>Analytics cookies recognise returning browsers. We do not send your name, email address, phone number or form entries to Google Analytics. We do not enable advertising personalisation or Google Signals. Analytics is optional, and the Google Analytics tag loads only after you allow it.</p>
    <p>Your cookie preference is saved in this browser for six months. You can change it here at any time. Declining stops analytics collection and removes this website’s Google Analytics cookies.</p>
    <p>OpenTable manages reservations and newsletter subscriptions on its own service. Our analytics measures when you open those options; it cannot confirm a completed reservation or newsletter subscription.</p>
    <p>Learn <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">how Google uses data from sites that use its services</a>. For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:hello@boardwalkprime.com">hello@boardwalkprime.com</a>.</p>
    <p data-bp-consent-status role="status"></p>
    <div class="bp-cookie-actions">
      <button type="button" data-bp-consent="denied">Decline analytics</button>
      <button type="button" data-bp-consent="granted">Allow analytics</button>
    </div>
  </article>
</dialog>
